rtico del sindaco, minacciando lo spirito natalizio della città. Questo emozionante inseguimento è carico di umorismo, colpi di scena sorprendenti e un pizzico di magia natalizia, ricordandoci che la gioia del Natale nasce dall'unità, dalle risate e, a volte, dalla ricerca del regalo perfetto e non convenzionale.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"The detectives are checking their list—and checking it twice.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2024-11-28","status":"Released","rating":3,"ratingCount":4,"genres":["Commedia","Famiglia","Crime"],"countries":[],"facts":{"Runtime":"107m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":575673,"name":"Jay Dee Walters","role":"Jack Tyler","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Ipicsph3a67URa72mKR1uD3JHs.jpg"},{"id":3016899,"name":"Ryan T. Johnson","role":"Sticky/Kenny Rogers"},{"id":3172148,"name":"Candace Kirkpatrick","role":"Maria Tyler","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xyOAw5afvMoYGRF2QXLJaiU6sl1.jpg"},{"id":1827243,"name":"Eric Hanson","role":"Fast Eddie","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2vokyfoVdYnHOzVRkOQC3I99KlC.jpg"},{"id":2585603,"name":"Phil Mendoza","role":"Marcos Fernandez"},{"id":1466402,"name":"Bill Jenkins","role":"Mayor Jim","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fdoedPhctMbSdlqHlzhLOgb91I5.jpg"},{"id":3311261,"name":"David D. Ford","role":"David","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eadDAXqcB2TId1ereysk5J0wubl.jpg"},{"id":105632,"name":"Natalie Jones","role":"Charley","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/59c5VI0ePg7FVAeHWiGCkXbyPQf.jpg"},{"id":4792742,"name":"Molly Peyton","role":"Sarah","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u4ZyzALb0i0YCNJQG6iQispZctw.jpg"},{"id":1356317,"name":"Kara Rainer","role":"Sally Jones","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tDVIxdrmh37WNG1omK0TSWoG0kO.jpg"},{"id":3728115,"name":"Noah Archibald","role":"Bobby","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k6f6rByFuvXWYk1bi2loougp9T9.jpg"},{"id":4792745,"name":"Cody C King","role":"Delivery Man"},{"id":4792746,"name":"Terry Higginbotham","role":"Izzy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vVTiJBTH9ZPRKySPhwJhKWyGZrf.jpg"},{"id":3665158,"name":"Kimberly Gail Williams","role":"Becky","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4EoEZ94qFEPCVMOapDacVTIWday.jpg"},{"id":3074540,"name":"Barbara Laurean","role":"Emily"},{"id":2529514,"name":"Hank Slaughter","role":"Captain Logan","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3E9KvmiAOKSkrkBr0iKzdWnEdL4.jpg"},{"id":4792747,"name":"Eric Mathews","role":"Ralph"},{"id":4792748,"name":"M.J. Martinez","role":"Hunter"},{"id":4792751,"name":"Larry Cassady","role":"Newscaster"},{"id":4792752,"name":"Bill Pope","role":"Frank"},{"id":4792753,"name":"Teresa Jones","role":"Karen"},{"id":4792756,"name":"Brooklyn Ray Davila","role":"Grace"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"In \"Porch Pirates\", tre detective, Jack Tyler, Marcos Fernandez e Sally Jones, affrontano la sfida di catturare un gruppo di ladri di feste. Mentre si sforzano di salvaguardare la stagione delle feste, gestiscono anche lotte personali. Jack bilancia il suo lavoro impegnativo con la sua vivace vita familiare, mentre il vedovo Marcos lotta con il suo dolore durante le feste. La trama si infittisce con una missione ad alto rischio per recuperare un prezioso Beanie Baby rubato dal portico del sindaco, minacciando lo spirito natalizio della città. Questo emozionante inseguimento è carico di umorismo, colpi di scena sorprendenti e un pizzico di magia natalizia, ricordandoci che la gioia del Natale nasce dall'unità, dalle risate e, a volte, dalla ricerca del regalo perfetto e non convenzionale."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"When a gang of bumbling porch pirates targets East Texas during the holiday season, three small-town detectives jump into action. Their mission? Recover stolen packages—including a rare Beanie Baby and the Mayor’s prized Christmas pickle—before Christmas spirit disappears. Packed with slapstick laughs, festive hijinks, and heartwarming moments, Porch Pirates is a family-friendly holiday comedy for all ages.","tagline":"The detectives are checking their list—and checking it twice."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hBncxxSXPDZ4c56bar3xgueHZfJ.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hBncxxSXPDZ4c56bar3xgueHZfJ.png","language":"en","width":679,"height":147}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6pimaWdX5hnno4jlpOIqwmiBAn4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6pimaWdX5hnno4jlpOIqwmiBAn4.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pjw6DicGvSYif1HlbGpugLpYRCe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pjw6DicGvSYif1HlbGpugLpYRCe.jpg","language":"en","width":1920,"height":1080},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezM5N2B6E1S1I82SQmArQvUPA6K.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ezM5N2B6E1S1I82SQmArQvUPA6K.jpg","language":"en","width":1920,"height":1080},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AeO3j2HTRGCBos9d8IeLMxe6FLc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AeO3j2HTRGCBos9d8IeLMxe6FLc.jpg","language":"xx","width":1920,"height":1080},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wiflDlX4EVrU6tWvel1TuYI1KuR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wiflDlX4EVrU6tWvel1TuYI1KuR.jpg","language":"xx","width":1920,"height":1080}]},"logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hBncxxSXPDZ4c56bar3xgueHZfJ.png","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6pimaWdX5hnno4jlpOIqwmiBAn4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pjw6DicGvSYif1HlbGpugLpYRCe.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1308632,"type":"movie","